{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "h13 API - V1",
    "description": "You should migrate your app to NestJS. \n\n<b>For this migration step you SHOULDN'T migrate this functionality:</b>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n    entire auth flow (including devices), basic auth and bearer auth\n    </li>\n    <li>\n    validation\n    </li>\n    <li>\n    create/update/delete for comments (because for this operations we need bearer auth), but read requests should work for comments that already are in DB\n    </li>\n    <li>\n    create/update/delete for likes for comments and for posts \n    (because for this operations we need bearer auth).\n    But read requests should work for likes that already are in DB when we read posts and comments\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<br />\n\nYour should implement all other functionality using NestJS. New Tests will help you to check yourself.",
